# Static Linux — Openbox minimal
# Tier: Minimum absolute (512 MB). Xorg. Very limited hardware, ARM32,
# servers that still want a light GUI.

openbox
tint2
jgmenu
# nitrogen was dropped from the official repos (unmaintained upstream,
# AUR-only now) — feh --bg-fill + ~/.fehbg is the actively-packaged
# equivalent. Verified 2026-09-21.
feh
picom

# Session / login
lightdm
lightdm-gtk-greeter

# File manager
pcmanfm
gvfs
xarchiver

# Bare essentials
lxterminal
lxappearance
# obconf (Openbox's own config GUI) was dropped from the repos — GTK2, EOL
# upstream. lxappearance-obconf folds the same Openbox theme/settings pane
# into lxappearance instead of pulling in a second, heavier app (obconf-qt
# would drag in Qt on a 512 MB tier). Verified 2026-09-21.
lxappearance-obconf
network-manager-applet
scrot
xdg-user-dirs

# Notifications
dunst
libnotify

# sl-screenshot on X11 (Super+Shift+S), sl-display-scale
xorg-xrandr
maim
xclip
